{#-
  The feedback dialog (SPEC §13, §15.1). base.njk renders it, after the
  footer and outside <main>, on every page with a page_id (all but the 404
  page; the footer is on every page) while features.feedback is exactly true, and loads src/js/feedback.js with
  it. Not inside the footer, whose ink ground sets paper text and a paper
  focus ring.

  It ships `hidden` and closed, so without JavaScript (or <dialog> support)
  it has no visible or accessible presence and "Send feedback" stays a link
  to the Contact page. feedback.js unhides it once its listeners are in
  place, swaps that link for a button that opens it, makes the status line a
  live region and chooses the Turnstile site key at run time: data-sitekey
  holds site.config.json's turnstileSiteKey, which it uses only where it is
  a real key and the host isn't a local or preview one. With no usable key
  (decision A1) it hides the field, the widget's box and Send, so the dialog
  holds the notice, Close and the line offering the Contact page.

  The form never submits anywhere: method="dialog" (a native submit, if the
  script's handler ever failed, only closes the dialog) and no `name` on the
  textarea, so the message can't end up in an address. novalidate: the
  script says what is wrong in the status line. Focus order: heading
  (focused on open), textarea, the Turnstile widget, Send, Cancel, then a
  link in the status line. The field's wrapper (data-feedback-field) is
  there only to be hidden. Nothing inline (SPEC §16.1): while an on-screen
  keyboard is open, feedback.js sets two custom properties on the dialog
  through the CSSOM, which style-src 'self' allows, and site.css fits the
  dialog above the keyboard with them (SPEC §13).
-#}
<dialog class="feedback-dialog" id="feedback-dialog" data-feedback-dialog aria-labelledby="feedback-title" aria-describedby="feedback-notice" data-sitekey="{{ site.turnstileSiteKey }}" hidden>
  <form class="feedback" method="dialog" novalidate>
    <h2 class="feedback__title" id="feedback-title" tabindex="-1">Send feedback</h2>
    <div class="feedback__notice" id="feedback-notice">{% include "notices/feedback.njk" %}</div>
    <div class="feedback__field" data-feedback-field>
      <label class="feedback__label" for="feedback-message">Your message</label>
      <textarea class="feedback__message" id="feedback-message" rows="6" maxlength="2000" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="feedback-hint"></textarea>
      <p class="feedback__hint" id="feedback-hint">Up to 2,000 characters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback__check" data-feedback-check></div>
    <div class="feedback__actions">
      <button class="button button--primary" type="submit" data-feedback-send>Send</button>
      <button class="button button--outline" type="button" data-feedback-cancel>Cancel</button>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback__status" id="feedback-status" data-feedback-status></div>
  </form>
</dialog>
